WEBVTT

00:01.420 --> 00:03.500
<i>With my brilliant track record,</i>

00:03.710 --> 00:06.090
<i>I was the ideal pilot
to lead the Earth team.</i>

00:06.590 --> 00:09.340
<i>We got off to a good start,
but at the last moment,</i>

00:09.800 --> 00:11.050
<i>I hit a snag.</i>

00:13.930 --> 00:16.640
<i>I thought I could shake off
my injuries, like before.</i>

00:17.140 --> 00:18.560
<i>But this time, it was different.</i>

00:20.400 --> 00:24.070
<i>Now, it's up to Molly
to drive our team to victory.</i>

00:26.240 --> 00:28.240
<i>Good luck, little mouse.</i>

00:28.780 --> 00:30.490
<i>You're gonna need it.</i>

02:07.290 --> 02:09.300
Hello? Is anyone there?

02:24.140 --> 02:26.400
You pilot a beautiful craft,
my darling.

02:30.610 --> 02:31.780
Mommy!

02:42.290 --> 02:43.290
Mommy!

03:18.280 --> 03:21.080
Young lady, it's time
you and I had a little talk.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.910
OK. But how's Rick?

03:24.250 --> 03:26.370
Rick's away for now.

03:26.540 --> 03:27.670
He's away? Can I...

03:27.830 --> 03:30.000
The best thing
that you can do for Rick

03:30.210 --> 03:32.000
is to be worthy of the place
he's given you.

03:32.960 --> 03:34.460
I'm taking his place?

03:37.680 --> 03:41.300
I hope you realize that I never
trusted you to pilot the Arrow.

03:41.470 --> 03:43.600
You have shown skill,
but you have also

03:43.770 --> 03:45.770
repeatedly refused to do
as you were told.

03:46.440 --> 03:47.730
But I can explain!

03:47.890 --> 03:50.690
This is no way to win
a competition, young lady.

03:50.860 --> 03:53.780
You must stay in line
from now on, or I promise you,

03:54.360 --> 03:56.280
this will be the end of racing.

03:56.450 --> 03:58.240
Both for you, and for us.

04:05.330 --> 04:06.620
Always Mr. Cheerful.

04:07.250 --> 04:09.420
He's such a... Whatever.

04:09.580 --> 04:11.210
I guess winning is not enough.

04:15.170 --> 04:17.880
Uh, listen.
About yesterday...

04:18.050 --> 04:21.720
I was so happy to see Rick,
I know I let you down.

04:21.930 --> 04:22.850
Are you angry with me?

04:23.220 --> 04:24.560
Yeah, I'm angry.

04:24.770 --> 04:27.480
-Well are you?
-Relax, I'm kidding.

04:36.860 --> 04:39.950
You mean Rick just left
during the night, without any warning?

04:40.110 --> 04:42.030
Jordan, do you know
where he went?

04:42.240 --> 04:43.830
Well you heard Don Wei.

04:43.990 --> 04:46.120
He doesn't want us
to look for him.

04:46.660 --> 04:48.460
Oh poor Rick.

04:49.210 --> 04:50.710
Molly, don't worry.

04:50.870 --> 04:53.880
I'm sure Rick will bounce back.
Rick is Rick.

04:54.210 --> 04:56.380
We can't do anything
for him, anyway.

04:56.550 --> 04:58.720
Don't forget,
he's the champ, you know?

05:02.680 --> 05:03.720
Hello.

05:04.100 --> 05:06.470
Today is your lucky day.

05:06.970 --> 05:10.730
Mr. Jordan, your name has been
chosen from all the competitors

05:10.940 --> 05:13.360
on Alwas to inaugurate
Para-Dice City,

05:13.770 --> 05:15.440
our new video arcade.

05:15.610 --> 05:16.900
Is this a joke?

05:19.070 --> 05:21.860
And here is
your personal VIP pass.

05:22.490 --> 05:23.410
Huh, really?

05:23.570 --> 05:25.620
For once I've won something?

05:26.080 --> 05:28.370
Come on, Molly.
It's time we had a little fun.

05:28.540 --> 05:30.080
I'm not so sure.

05:30.250 --> 05:32.790
Para-Dice City, here we come!

05:32.960 --> 05:34.210
Meow.

05:34.710 --> 05:36.170
Right into my trap.

05:36.460 --> 05:38.210
Humans are so predictable.

05:38.460 --> 05:41.300
Meow, meow, meow.

05:57.320 --> 06:00.900
Just slip your card in,
and the fun begins.

06:01.190 --> 06:02.400
Right here?

06:14.330 --> 06:15.750
Wow, this is great!

06:24.470 --> 06:25.470
What is this thing?

06:25.640 --> 06:27.300
Come on, let's check it out!

06:27.470 --> 06:28.310
Hey!

06:34.310 --> 06:36.230
They call this an arcade?

06:36.400 --> 06:38.320
Whatever it is,
I don't like it.

06:40.610 --> 06:42.070
Hang on. It's lighting up.

06:46.530 --> 06:48.030
Welcome, humans.

06:48.200 --> 06:49.530
I'm Para-Dice.

06:49.700 --> 06:50.830
And you're not.

06:52.830 --> 06:54.620
Ha! I guess this is it.

06:55.210 --> 06:56.250
Yeah.

06:56.830 --> 06:57.580
Let 'er rip.

07:06.180 --> 07:07.760
Koji, what's going on?

07:08.430 --> 07:09.800
Blackout. Maybe.

07:09.970 --> 07:12.220
Can you beat
my super high score?

07:12.390 --> 07:13.770
I sincerely doubt it.

07:15.440 --> 07:16.230
What the?

07:20.150 --> 07:22.110
Hey, there's one
like the Arrow 2.

07:23.860 --> 07:26.400
You can take the pilot's seat,
I'll handle the guns.

07:26.570 --> 07:28.280
-I don't...
-Come on.

07:30.450 --> 07:31.330
If you insist.

07:38.040 --> 07:39.420
Everything looks fine.

07:51.390 --> 07:52.140
What on earth?

07:55.640 --> 07:57.390
I can see
that you don't want to play.

07:57.810 --> 07:59.270
Jordan, look out!
Here they come!

08:00.150 --> 08:02.480
No sweat. I was born
with a game pad in my hands.

08:09.030 --> 08:10.030
This looks very bad.

08:10.700 --> 08:12.160
Take that, alien scum!

08:17.710 --> 08:18.830
KOji!

08:19.000 --> 08:20.080
What's going on?

08:24.840 --> 08:26.970
It's a virus.
A really big one.

08:32.970 --> 08:34.470
All right. Great game!

08:34.760 --> 08:37.350
Yeah, this is just like
the real thing. Gotcha!

08:43.060 --> 08:44.650
Oh, wow.
Is this the end boss?

08:50.360 --> 08:51.240
What's this?

08:51.990 --> 08:54.620
It's gonna blow! Yeah!

08:57.700 --> 09:00.830
Jordan, help me out of here.
I can't shake 'em. Do something!

09:01.370 --> 09:03.040
You do something!
There's hundreds.

09:03.210 --> 09:04.630
My hands are numb.

09:10.340 --> 09:11.300
Oh man!

09:14.720 --> 09:16.850
Game over.
See ya next time!

09:17.850 --> 09:19.480
Ah! We got murdered.

09:20.060 --> 09:22.400
Yeah. Good thing
it wasn't for real.

09:30.450 --> 09:31.950
Koji, how's the Arrow?

09:32.530 --> 09:34.030
I guess we're lucky
I was able to shut off

09:34.200 --> 09:35.580
that hacker at the last moment.

09:35.740 --> 09:37.040
We still have one reactor.

09:44.670 --> 09:46.170
The pit's on fire!

09:49.260 --> 09:50.470
Just in time for clean-up.

09:50.800 --> 09:52.430
You missed all the fun.

10:01.390 --> 10:02.600
The left engine.

10:02.770 --> 10:04.270
Molly, you don't think that...

10:04.440 --> 10:07.360
Don't go there, Jordan.
It's only a coincidence.

10:09.190 --> 10:11.320
Your team is so disappointing.

10:11.610 --> 10:13.400
They got the lowest score, ever.

10:13.860 --> 10:14.990
Look. Over there!

10:18.160 --> 10:20.870
I must say,
your security system is pathetic.

10:21.450 --> 10:22.910
-Para-Dice!
-Huh?

10:24.790 --> 10:27.630
A 12-year-old can crack it.
Blindfolded.

10:28.420 --> 10:31.170
I should know,
I'll be 12 next week.

10:32.720 --> 10:35.970
If I find that cat,
I'll take all nine of its lives!

10:36.180 --> 10:37.430
How is she getting in?

10:37.600 --> 10:40.310
This computer is not even
connected to the network.

10:40.470 --> 10:42.680
Hey, there's my drill.

10:42.850 --> 10:44.230
I was wondering where I left it.

10:44.520 --> 10:45.190
What?

10:45.350 --> 10:48.650
A short-range HF connection.
Well of course.

10:51.610 --> 10:54.320
Why don't you abandon
the race right now?

10:54.570 --> 10:55.910
I won't tell anyone.

10:56.160 --> 10:58.740
I mean, that would be
so much easier for me.

11:01.330 --> 11:03.250
Yeah, sure. Anything else?

11:04.250 --> 11:05.830
No. That'll be all.

11:06.500 --> 11:07.330
Get her!

11:07.670 --> 11:08.290
Meow!

11:09.250 --> 11:10.040
Meow!

11:10.590 --> 11:11.590
Meow!

11:12.130 --> 11:13.130
Meow!

11:13.920 --> 11:15.880
-Para-Dice!
-Meow!

11:16.300 --> 11:17.680
Everyone to their post.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.930
We have less than an hour
till race time.

11:20.100 --> 11:21.350
Yes, sir!

11:21.510 --> 11:23.140
Do you two know
something about this?

11:23.470 --> 11:24.560
Huh?

11:28.230 --> 11:30.150
A game arcade!

11:30.900 --> 11:33.820
Your indiscretion almost cost us
our last star-racer.

11:34.280 --> 11:36.360
Have you already
forgotten my promise?

11:36.530 --> 11:37.570
But sir, I...

11:37.740 --> 11:39.870
I apologize, sir.
Won't happen again.

11:41.330 --> 11:44.790
If you have understood your error,
then get ready to race.

11:49.130 --> 11:51.840
It was my fault we went
to that stupid arcade.

11:52.090 --> 11:54.550
Thanks for taking the heat, Molly.
I owe you one.

11:54.800 --> 11:56.630
Hey, forget it.
What are partners for?

12:06.940 --> 12:10.360
Today we continue
the fourth round of preselections

12:10.520 --> 12:12.230
with the Earth team.

12:22.370 --> 12:23.790
That ship looks awful.

12:24.660 --> 12:27.410
Sir, beauty's more
than just paint. She flies.

12:29.540 --> 12:33.710
Racing the Little Prodigy,
from the planet Weta, Para-Dice!

12:41.720 --> 12:42.680
Meow.

12:42.850 --> 12:45.470
Takes a lot of courage
to fly a wreck like that.

12:45.770 --> 12:48.430
But don't expect me
to go easy on you, big girl.

12:48.940 --> 12:50.310
My name is Molly.

12:50.480 --> 12:53.400
And this is no longer
one of your games, Para-Dice.

12:53.650 --> 12:55.110
This is for real.

12:55.280 --> 12:56.730
You will never learn.

12:56.900 --> 12:59.200
I'll never let you get
the Ultimate Prize.

13:00.150 --> 13:00.910
Wham?

13:01.660 --> 13:03.530
The Ultimate Prize?

13:05.490 --> 13:09.290
Today's race will include
another special rule.

13:10.830 --> 13:12.170
Arena race.

13:14.130 --> 13:16.590
Oh great.
This is going to be so much fun.

13:38.990 --> 13:39.780
What's going on?

13:56.210 --> 13:56.960
We have visual now.

13:57.380 --> 13:59.670
Molly, can you hear me?
Do you copy?

14:04.680 --> 14:06.680
What is this place?

14:07.510 --> 14:09.520
I guess it's our arena.

14:12.390 --> 14:14.690
Ready or not, here I come!

14:16.560 --> 14:18.610
You didn't hide very well.

14:20.150 --> 14:22.650
Fly, little missile.
Fly, fly away!

14:30.580 --> 14:32.040
Come on, Jordi.
Come on.

14:40.090 --> 14:42.260
Missiles closing in.
I can't hold them off.

14:53.430 --> 14:54.350
You lost her.

14:56.230 --> 14:57.730
Right. Dead ahead!

15:03.610 --> 15:04.610
Another arena?

15:04.950 --> 15:07.280
Jordan, this looks
really familiar.

15:08.570 --> 15:10.540
Molly! This race is not a...

15:10.700 --> 15:13.580
She can't hear you, sir.
The communications are scrambled.

15:15.580 --> 15:17.290
Then how can I give her my orders?

15:21.130 --> 15:23.260
There you are! Peek-a-boo!

15:23.800 --> 15:24.800
Para-Dice.

15:25.340 --> 15:27.010
You're hopeless
at hide-and-seek.

15:29.510 --> 15:31.390
We're back where we started.

15:42.570 --> 15:44.490
Where did those mice go?

15:52.080 --> 15:55.540
Come out, come out,
wherever you are.

16:09.090 --> 16:11.220
This place is one big maze.
What now?

16:11.800 --> 16:15.560
If this place is a maze,
there must be a way out of here.

16:16.980 --> 16:18.850
Got any bright ideas?

16:20.100 --> 16:21.860
Why don't we go out
the way we came in?

16:24.150 --> 16:25.740
Where are they?

16:29.360 --> 16:30.320
There they are.

16:30.950 --> 16:32.740
Turn, little cannon! Turn!

16:33.830 --> 16:34.950
Turn, turn, turn!

16:49.050 --> 16:51.430
Molly, you've got to make
a choice, and hurry!

16:51.890 --> 16:53.720
I'm trying,
but they all look the same.

17:02.440 --> 17:03.980
The repairs!
Are they still holding?

17:04.440 --> 17:06.940
For the moment, yes.
But ask me again in five minutes.

17:12.280 --> 17:13.530
Just give up, Molly.

17:13.700 --> 17:15.240
I want the Ultimate Prize

17:15.410 --> 17:18.200
very, very, very, very, very badly.

17:18.370 --> 17:20.920
What are you talking about?
All you talk is nonsense.

17:21.120 --> 17:22.920
Don't play innocent with me!

17:23.080 --> 17:25.000
You know very well
that the Ultimate Prize

17:25.170 --> 17:27.050
gives the winner
any wish, any dream.

17:27.340 --> 17:28.300
It can't be.

17:28.590 --> 17:30.260
I could have any wish?

17:30.420 --> 17:31.880
Any dream?

17:32.050 --> 17:33.340
You have a wish...

17:33.510 --> 17:35.220
-Don't you, Molly?
-Mommy!

17:56.870 --> 17:58.740
Game's over, Molly!

17:58.910 --> 18:01.460
Looks like you lost, again.

18:06.130 --> 18:08.300
I'll buy us some time
to find a way out, Molly.

18:08.460 --> 18:10.380
Just get me in
as close as you can.

18:11.050 --> 18:13.180
OK, Jordan.
Just keep us out of the lake.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.180
Meow, meow!

18:18.430 --> 18:19.520
Somebody hit that cat!

18:22.690 --> 18:23.560
Meow!

18:24.060 --> 18:25.350
Meow!

18:30.440 --> 18:32.990
Repairs aren't holding!
The left reactor's out!

18:34.160 --> 18:36.370
Molly! Eject now!
That's an order!

18:36.530 --> 18:38.030
You know she can't hear you, sir.

18:38.370 --> 18:39.410
Molly!

18:44.620 --> 18:45.290
That water!

18:47.750 --> 18:49.130
We hit that pipe!

18:49.590 --> 18:50.590
That's where we entered.

18:52.760 --> 18:55.010
Molly, what are you doing?
Head for the water!

18:55.470 --> 18:56.590
I'm sure it's here.

19:12.070 --> 19:13.940
The Ultimate Prize is mine!

19:14.110 --> 19:14.900
Mine! Mine!

19:15.150 --> 19:15.950
Mine!

19:17.410 --> 19:18.490
Mine, mine, mine!

19:42.220 --> 19:43.600
We have a winner! It's...

19:48.480 --> 19:50.610
The Earth team!

19:59.820 --> 20:02.030
Yeah! They really did it!

20:02.200 --> 20:03.580
They're just so great!

20:03.740 --> 20:06.250
And now we have to do
the repairs all over again.

20:06.410 --> 20:08.540
What else would we do?
We're mechanics.

20:11.750 --> 20:12.960
We did it, partner.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.800
I guess so.

20:18.840 --> 20:22.260
Mr. President, I need to know
about the Ultimate Prize.

20:22.970 --> 20:25.560
You have sent us here
to fight for the Earth.

20:25.730 --> 20:27.020
We're fighting.

20:28.640 --> 20:30.980
But I cannot continue
to risk my crew

20:31.150 --> 20:33.190
unless you answer my question.

20:36.150 --> 20:38.950
You'll find certain truths
are better left unknown.

20:42.070 --> 20:45.700
But since you insist, switch
to the secure channel immediately.

20:58.800 --> 21:01.010
Is it true about the Ultimate Prize?

21:01.180 --> 21:03.220
Does it really give you
any wish, any dream?

21:05.560 --> 21:09.270
I guess you'll just have to win
the Great Race of Oban to know.

21:18.490 --> 21:20.150
What's this all about?

21:21.610 --> 21:24.700
<i>You shouldn't
underestimate your own daughter.</i>

21:26.450 --> 21:30.000
<i>You're in for a big surprise.</i>
